The library is platform-free C++20: no RTOS, no SDK, no heap. It builds as one CMake target, `xmpl100::xmpl100`, with
one include root, `@ROOT@/`.

## What you get

- **`MovingAverage<N>`**, the template's example utility: the mean of the last samples in fixed storage. See
  [API guide](api-guide.md).
- **Errors you can act on.** Every fallible call returns `Result<T>` with an `Error`. See [Contract](contract.md).
- **No heap, no exceptions, no RTTI.** The host tests build with `-fno-exceptions -fno-rtti`. See
  [Testing and CI](testing.md).
- **One include root and one target.** See [Integration](integration.md).

